# AUZiX tiny netinstall remote-first package profile.
#
# Keep this list intentionally small. It is the installer-core payload needed
# to boot, get network, accept SSH, partition/format, refresh the AUZiX package
# repo, and install selected package groups after first boot. Desktop and demo
# packages do not belong here.

BusyBox
AuzixPackageTools
AuzixInstaller
OpenSSH
Sudo
CACerts
Curl
UtilLinux
Iproute2
E2fsprogs
Dosfstools
Parted
Strace
File
AuzixServiceRuntime
